@TheJukeBox_HostAddress = https://localhost:7077

### Landing page
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/html

### Player page
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/player
Accept: text/html

### Full audio library
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles
Accept: application/json

### Library statistics
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/stats
Accept: application/json

### Search audio files by name
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/audiofiles/search-audio?term=blue
Accept: application/json

### OAuth setup instructions
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/auth/setup
Accept: application/json

### Stored token health
GET {{TheJukeBox_HostAddress}}/api/auth/test-token
Accept: application/json

###
